    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but small choices don't change anything. the walls are too high. it's like i'm drowning in slow motion and everyone is just watching me pretend to swim. there's no version of this where i actually get to be me. it's just... it feels like the only way to actually be free of all these demands is to not be here at all.",
